# Mosquitto ACL template for Smart Garden.
# Server copy: ./mosquitto_acl next to docker-compose.yml, owner uid 1883 (mosquitto), mode 600.
# A user without an entry here has no access. MQTT 3.1.1 does not report a denied
# publish to the client: the message is dropped silently (see docs/SECURITY_SETUP.md).

# Backend: reads measurements, confirms them (BE-1-4).
user backend
topic read smartgarden/+/data
topic write smartgarden/+/ack

# One user per device: writes only its own data, reads only its own ack (ESP-2-4).
# The topic id must equal DEVICE_ID of the gateway (ESP-1-2).
user device-2
topic write smartgarden/2/data
topic read smartgarden/2/ack
